# Copy to .env. Recommended: Option D, a real language model on your own
# server (no API key, nothing leaves the server). See llm/README.fa.md.
#
# Option D — self-hosted model (Ollama). Wins over A and B when set.
# LLM_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
# LLM_MODEL=qwen3:8b
# LLM_CTX=8192
# LLM_TIMEOUT_MS=240000
# Per-process/isolate active requests; tune only for real parallel capacity.
# LLM_MAX_ACTIVE=1
# LLM_MAX_TOKENS=4096
# For llama.cpp / vLLM / LM Studio instead of Ollama:
# LLM_API=openai
# LLM_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1
# LLM_KEY=optional-local-service-key
# Qwen3 defaults to thinking off in the compatible API. Use on to opt in,
# or off for a Qwen3 model served under an alias.
# LLM_THINKING=off
#
# Or put one key in it. .env is never committed and never
# reaches the browser: only the server reads it.
#
# Option A — Claude (Anthropic). No speech-to-text: dictation still works in
# the browser, but converting a recorded audio file to text is unavailable.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5

# Option C — our own speech model (stt/server.py). No API key; audio stays on
# your server. Works with or without A or B.
# STT_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765
# STT_TOKEN=choose-a-long-random-string
# Per Node process and Worker isolate, respectively:
# STT_PROXY_MAX_ACTIVE=2
# STT_WORKER_MAX_ACTIVE=2
# STT_TIMEOUT_MS=180000
# On the separate Python speech server (not just in this .env):
# STT_MAX_PENDING=2
# STT_MAX_CONNECTIONS=16
# STT_READ_TIMEOUT=30
# STT_UPLOAD_TIMEOUT=120
# STT_MAX_SECONDS=185

# Option B — OpenAI. Adds audio-file transcription.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-6-astra
# OPENAI_TRANSCRIBE_MODEL=gpt-transcribe

# With neither key the site still works: the browser engine does the whole
# analysis on its own and the interface says so.
#
# Optional central intake: Node server.mjs ONLY, behind a trusted TLS proxy.
# Leave disabled until both HTTPS origins, credentials, accounts, backups and
# the real-device/security acceptance checks are complete. dev.mjs and the
# Worker build do not provide the central service.
CENTRAL_ENABLED=0
# APP_ORIGIN=https://frgserver.ir
# ADMIN_ORIGIN=https://admin.frgserver.ir
# CENTRAL_DATA_DIR=/var/lib/ravi
# CENTRAL_DATA_KEY_FILE=/etc/ravi/data.key
# BALE_BOT_TOKEN_FILE=/etc/ravi/bale.token
# BALE_MAX_AUTH_AGE_SECONDS=7200
# CENTRAL_MAX_UPLOADS=2
# Never set CENTRAL_ALLOW_INSECURE_DEV on an exposed server.
